2px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"btn dark\" href=\"/contact/?service=BIM%20Execution%20Planning\">Request this service <i aria-hidden=\"true\">&#8599;</i></a></div></div>\n  <div class=\"sdside\">\n    <div><p class=\"lab\">Available disciplines</p><ul class=\"deliv\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><li>BIM Management</li><li>Architecture</li><li>Structural</li><li>MEP</li></ul></div>    <div><p class=\"lab\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px\">Typical tools</p><div class=\"chiprow \"><span>ISO 19650 workflows</span><span>Autodesk Construction Cloud</span><span>Navisworks</span><span>Revit</span></div></div>  </div>\n</div></section>\n\n\n\n<section class=\"coal pad\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"head\"><div><p class=\"lab\">Delivery workflow</p><h2 class=\"h2\">How BIM Execution Planning <em>runs.</em></h2></div><p class=\"lead\">Five stages, with QA/QC before anything is issued.</p></div>\n  <div class=\"flow f5\"><div class=\"rv\"><b>01</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Scope &amp; BEP</h3><p>Confirm deliverables, LOD/LOI matrix and standards.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>02</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Review</h3><p>Client information requirements, contract and existing workflows reviewed against what the project needs.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>03</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Write</h3><p>BEP, LOD/LOI matrix, responsibility matrix, naming, CDE structure and model checking rules drafted with your team.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>04</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">QA/QC</h3><p>Run model health, standards and clash checks before issue.</p></div></div><div class=\"rv\"><b>05</b><div><h3 class=\"h3\">Support</h3><p>The plan kept current through delivery: model audits, coordination reviews and change control when requirements move.</p></div></div></div>\n</div></section>\n\n<section class=\"paper pad\"><div class=\"wrap wf\">\n  <div><p class=\"lab\">Insights</p><h2 class=\"h2\">BIM Execution Planning, <em>explained.</em></h2><a class=\"btn dark\" style=\"margin-top:34px\" h